{"4669120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Divine Revenant", "steam_appid": 4669120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS MISSION IS IN YOUR HANDS ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will gather resources on the fly, craft tools and utilize anything in your arsenal to survive the horrors that lurk in this disgraced place. You will either complete your mission or become yet another forgotten grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/be96a96640b066b91300e372216d93e7.poster.avif?t=1788093627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/be96a96640b066b91300e372216d93e7.webm?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/be96a96640b066b91300e372216d93e7.mp4?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE FORSAKEN BURIAL GROUNDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is festering with nameless corpses and those whose only purpose is to keep them buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you uncover all of the secrets this land would rather keep buried or will you prioritize your mission above all else?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/01372f1f549b77df088ef63a70d3395b.poster.avif?t=1788093627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/01372f1f549b77df088ef63a70d3395b.webm?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/01372f1f549b77df088ef63a70d3395b.mp4?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster has different behaviors and pose a deadly threat in their own unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will be able to figure out their weaknesses before they hunt you down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/390ad85e96036413f5f3382bd170e0b2.poster.avif?t=1788093627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/390ad85e96036413f5f3382bd170e0b2.webm?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/390ad85e96036413f5f3382bd170e0b2.mp4?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS DIVINE REVENANT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Revenant is a first-person horror game where you play as Alicia, an oath-sworn knight who is on a mission to recover her Lord's corpse. She has nothing left to lose anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/81c9556d9dd2813e3fd0378bfa1b0ed2.poster.avif?t=1788093627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/81c9556d9dd2813e3fd0378bfa1b0ed2.webm?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669120/extras/81c9556d9dd2813e3fd0378bfa1b0ed2.mp4?t=1788093627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v